    "an>سازا</span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"bar-end\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-line btn-sm",
    "\" id=\"installBtn\" hidden>نصب اپ</button>\n      <span class=\"chip only-user\">اعتبار: <b id=",
